WEBVTT

00:09.740 --> 00:12.500
Father... Mother...

00:13.030 --> 00:16.490
My older brothers, Chris and Ren...

00:18.770 --> 00:20.500
I've missed you!

00:23.090 --> 00:25.260
I love all of you so much!

00:25.260 --> 00:26.750
I love you!

00:26.750 --> 00:28.120
Elise?

00:28.120 --> 00:29.780
What's wrong, Elise?

00:29.780 --> 00:32.690
You poor dear. It must 
have been so difficult.

00:32.690 --> 00:36.750
I did tell you, husband. Her 
punishment was much too severe!

00:37.830 --> 00:40.140
It seems I may have gone a little too far.

00:40.550 --> 00:42.340
I'm sorry, Elise.

00:43.650 --> 00:44.920
Don't cry any more.

00:44.920 --> 00:46.510
Chris-oniisama...

00:46.960 --> 00:50.770
A lady awaiting her betrothal 
shouldn't cry in front of others.

00:52.990 --> 00:56.500
Um, regarding my betrothal...

00:56.500 --> 01:01.580
I've already discussed that matter with 
His Majesty, so there's no need to worry.

01:01.580 --> 01:03.950
Your betrothal to Crown Prince Linden

01:03.950 --> 01:06.800
will be formally announced 
at the birthday celebration.

01:06.800 --> 01:09.460
Everything is just as you wished.

01:09.460 --> 01:11.130
No, I...

01:11.130 --> 01:14.410
Father, I will ask you frankly...

01:14.410 --> 01:18.960
Do you believe that Elise is a good match 
for the crown prince?

01:19.290 --> 01:24.720
I realize it's insolent of me to question
 the emperor's decision,

01:25.340 --> 01:27.840
but I oppose this betrothal.

01:27.840 --> 01:30.020
Brother, what are you saying?

01:34.260 --> 01:35.420
Elise?

01:35.860 --> 01:38.190
<i>Ren-oniisama hasn't changed at all.</i>

01:39.150 --> 01:42.570
<i>I used to truly hate his sharp tongue,</i>

01:42.940 --> 01:45.700
<i>but this time, it's exactly as he says.</i>

01:46.280 --> 01:49.120
You see? You're being too harsh.

01:50.170 --> 01:54.080
For Elise not to make some sort 
of retort is no trifling matter.

01:54.080 --> 01:58.590
<i>My first life was full of regrets 
because of my own actions.</i>

01:59.070 --> 01:59.840
<i>But...</i>

02:01.500 --> 02:06.440
<i>my selfishness caused the crown prince 
to meet with much misfortune.</i>

02:07.020 --> 02:10.360
<i>I can't face the birthday 
celebration like this.</i>

02:10.360 --> 02:13.220
<i>I must ensure that I don't 
make the same mistakes again.</i>

02:17.160 --> 02:19.820
<i>I must assemble as much information as I can,</i>

02:19.820 --> 02:22.300
<i>so that I understand what's to come!</i>

04:04.000 --> 04:08.270
<i>My second eldest brother Chris 
dies in the Kusef campaign.</i>

04:08.270 --> 04:10.420
<i>Our step-mother Emily dies of illness.</i>

04:10.420 --> 04:12.470
<i>There's the Rebellion of 
the House of Trestan.</i>

04:13.460 --> 04:16.060
<i>For the crime of protecting Empress Elise,</i>

04:16.060 --> 04:19.340
<i>my father, Ell, and my eldest 
brother are executed.</i>

04:20.160 --> 04:22.940
<i>And with that, the House of Clorence...</i>

04:23.580 --> 04:24.610
<i>is extinguished.</i>

04:30.380 --> 04:35.350
<i>The initial expeditionary force to Kusef 
dies due to an unknown contagious disease.</i>

04:35.350 --> 04:38.280
<i>Estimated fatalities are 
forty-seven thousand people.</i>

04:38.850 --> 04:42.680
<i>Emperor Minchester dies of a 
worsening chronic illness.</i>

04:43.240 --> 04:47.290
<i>After the Kusef War, an epidemic 
rising in the east spreads,</i>

04:47.290 --> 04:49.040
<i>and three towns in the south are closed off.</i>

04:49.430 --> 04:51.770
<i>Estimated fatalities are 
seventy thousand people.</i>

04:55.330 --> 04:57.980
<i>Because medical science 
isn't advanced in this era,</i>

04:57.980 --> 05:00.840
<i>many of the problems have 
to do with illnesses.</i>

05:02.270 --> 05:06.230
Mistress, I've brought you your tea.

05:06.450 --> 05:08.820
Oh! It's a strawberry tart!

05:08.820 --> 05:10.320
Thank you, Mary.

05:13.330 --> 05:14.380
Is something wrong?

05:15.350 --> 05:17.070
No, it's...

05:17.070 --> 05:19.880
I didn't expect to be thanked, so...

05:19.880 --> 05:23.160
I was, um, just a little surprised.

05:24.350 --> 05:29.650
<i>Well, yes, given the person I was before...</i>

05:30.300 --> 05:32.290
<i>I'd get angry over the littlest things,</i>

05:32.290 --> 05:35.610
<i>and take that anger out on those 
around me constantly.</i>

05:35.610 --> 05:38.160
<i>After Prince Linden acceded to the throne,</i>

05:38.160 --> 05:40.650
<i>I became the worst possible empress.</i>

05:40.650 --> 05:41.950
<i>And ten years after that...</i>

05:52.420 --> 05:54.790
I-I'm so terribly sorry!

05:55.750 --> 05:56.970
Ow!

05:58.910 --> 06:00.150
Let me see.

06:02.140 --> 06:05.420
Oh, good! It looks like you 
didn't get any shards in it.

06:05.680 --> 06:08.500
But we should rinse the wound with water.

06:08.500 --> 06:10.770
I-I couldn't possibly!

06:10.770 --> 06:12.670
I'm perfectly fine! Everything is fine!

06:13.080 --> 06:16.860
There's no need to trouble yourself, 
Mistress! I can do it by myself!

06:16.860 --> 06:17.800
Really?

06:17.800 --> 06:18.690
Yes! Yes!

06:19.080 --> 06:20.320
In that case...

06:21.470 --> 06:25.060
After you've thoroughly washed 
it, wrap it with a clean cloth.

06:25.350 --> 06:27.380
Do it in a way that will 
keep the wound closed.

06:27.380 --> 06:29.060
And don't wrap it too tightly.

06:30.680 --> 06:32.010
Are you listening, Mary?

06:32.010 --> 06:33.450
Y-Yes, Mistress!

06:36.900 --> 06:40.300
Thank you so much, Mistress!

06:42.770 --> 06:45.810
Truly, thank you so very much.

06:48.900 --> 06:53.000
<i>I'm sure of it now. I want to live 
as a doctor in this world, too.</i>

06:53.460 --> 06:57.450
<i>If there are lives that my medical 
knowledge can save, I want to save them.</i>

06:58.020 --> 07:00.320
<i>There's only one way to do that.</i>

07:01.490 --> 07:03.640
<i>Tomorrow will be a head-to-head battle.</i>

07:15.740 --> 07:18.360
I am Elise de Clorence.

07:18.730 --> 07:23.360
Marquis, Lady Elise, welcome.

07:24.060 --> 07:26.540
And Sir Vent, it's been some 
time since we last met.

07:27.090 --> 07:29.630
Now, come sit here.

07:29.630 --> 07:31.130
Yes, Your Majesty.

07:32.310 --> 07:35.760
I'm sorry for calling you here so suddenly.

07:35.760 --> 07:39.390
Seeing the young lady's face after 
some absence makes me very happy.

07:39.920 --> 07:41.820
<i>He's as kind as always.</i>

07:40.100 --> 07:44.840
The pleasure is ours. We've been looking 
forward seeing you again, Your Majesty.

07:42.380 --> 07:45.270
<i>Palace life leaves no time for 
the heart and mind to rest.</i>

07:45.750 --> 07:50.010
<i>How many times did His Majesty's 
kindness save the old me?</i>

07:45.750 --> 07:50.280
Marquis Ell, Elise has only 
grown more and more beautiful.

07:51.780 --> 07:53.140
<i>And yet...</i>

07:56.670 --> 07:59.660
I'll leave it to you, Elise.

07:59.660 --> 08:02.950
Become a good and praiseworthy empress.

08:02.950 --> 08:04.160
Your Majesty!

08:13.220 --> 08:17.180
<i>I couldn't do anything for him then.</i>

08:17.690 --> 08:22.040
No, no. She's quite a willful girl, so 
we're often at a loss with her.

08:18.350 --> 08:20.970
<i>Right now, is his health all right?</i>

08:21.710 --> 08:22.970
<i>Is his illness...</i>

08:25.310 --> 08:29.720
Your demeanor seems different 
than it usually does, young lady.

08:30.880 --> 08:32.720
D-Does it?

08:32.720 --> 08:35.560
As the birthday celebration 
is drawing nearer,

08:35.560 --> 08:38.240
I'm sure the lady has much on her mind.

08:39.630 --> 08:45.170
If that's the case, then I look forward even 
more to welcoming her as the next empress.

08:45.170 --> 08:46.740
<i>I have to hurry up and say it.</i>

08:48.980 --> 08:50.910
Your Majesty...

08:50.910 --> 08:53.310
there is a matter I earnestly 
wish to discuss with you.

08:55.270 --> 08:56.450
The truth is...

08:56.860 --> 08:58.800
I apologize for my tardiness.

09:15.810 --> 09:18.030
<i>His Highness, Crown Prince Linden.</i>

09:32.550 --> 09:36.190
<i>I was once in love with this 
brusqueness of his, too, wasn't I?</i>

09:36.910 --> 09:38.040
<i>But...</i>

09:38.960 --> 09:41.250
I've brought you some tea.

09:41.250 --> 09:42.830
It will interfere with my reading.

09:42.830 --> 09:43.610
What?

09:43.610 --> 09:46.590
And I would like to end this strange 
misunderstanding of yours.

09:46.950 --> 09:51.310
I married you under my 
father's orders, that's all.

09:53.250 --> 09:56.340
Why is that man so cold to me?

09:56.340 --> 09:58.710
I'll make him look my way!

09:58.710 --> 10:00.840
No matter what it takes!

10:03.010 --> 10:06.620
<i>And all of it was my own fault. 
Really, I was such an idiot.</i>

10:07.360 --> 10:11.190
That seems to have taken 
quite some time, Linden.

10:11.190 --> 10:12.000
Yes.

10:12.390 --> 10:17.640
The discussion of the Kusef campaign's 
budget with the Ministry of Finance ran long.

10:17.640 --> 10:19.240
The Kusef expedition?

10:19.240 --> 10:20.520
Is something wrong?

10:20.520 --> 10:21.380
N-Not at all!

10:21.910 --> 10:25.780
Does something worry you 
about the upcoming campaign?

10:25.780 --> 10:27.400
If it does, tell us.

10:29.240 --> 10:32.640
<i>Back then, I was ignorant of the 
world and didn't know anything,</i>

10:32.640 --> 10:33.960
<i>but now I do know.</i>

10:34.480 --> 10:37.090
<i>The Kusef campaign will end in failure.</i>

10:37.090 --> 10:39.400
<i>In a tragic way, at that.</i>

10:39.640 --> 10:43.410
<i>And in the resulting war, 
Chris-oniisama will lose his life.</i>

10:43.760 --> 10:45.910
Don't deliberate so deeply.

10:45.910 --> 10:48.420
If you have something to say, 
don't hesitate to say it.

10:49.040 --> 10:50.610
<i>Should I tell them?</i>

10:50.610 --> 10:52.940
<i>But they may wonder why 
I'd know such a thing,</i>

10:52.940 --> 10:55.300
<i>and look at me with suspicion in their eyes.</i>

11:01.970 --> 11:05.570
<i>But this could reduce the 
number of casualties.</i>

11:06.150 --> 11:11.800
Then, by your leave, I 
will offer my opinion.

11:11.800 --> 11:13.690
Yes, please do.

11:16.700 --> 11:19.950
In this war, the worst case scenario 
is the Kingdom of Moncelle,

11:19.950 --> 11:22.970
from the eastern part of the 
continent, joining in.

11:22.970 --> 11:24.460
The Kingdom of Moncelle?

11:26.330 --> 11:27.450
Really?

11:28.950 --> 11:33.770
Lady Elise, during the campaign, 
it's the Republic of Fresgard

11:33.770 --> 11:35.860
that we need to be most wary of.

11:35.860 --> 11:37.180
Geopolitically speaking,

11:37.180 --> 11:41.580
the Kingdom of Moncelle has no reason to 
participate in a war on the Kusef Peninsula.

11:42.020 --> 11:44.250
No, they do have a reason.

11:44.780 --> 11:45.850
What is it?

11:46.490 --> 11:51.330
The current ruler of the Kingdom 
of Moncelle, Count Igleent.

11:52.170 --> 11:55.810
He hasn't been acknowledged as king there.

11:55.810 --> 11:59.460
If he wants to legitimize his position, 
then he needs their suzerain state,

11:59.460 --> 12:02.640
the Republic of Fresgard,
 to acknowledge him.

12:03.120 --> 12:06.480
The Republic of Fresgard 
will have noticed this,

12:06.480 --> 12:09.560
and in exchange for legitimizing 
Count Igleent's rule,

12:09.560 --> 12:13.180
may ask for his involvement 
in order to intimidate us.

12:15.880 --> 12:17.240
I see.

12:19.110 --> 12:22.110
The Kingdom of Moncelle has a military 
force of roughly twenty thousand.

12:22.490 --> 12:26.860
Are you saying that a force of that size 
would intimidate the most powerful country

12:26.860 --> 12:29.430
in the west of the continent, 
our Britia Empire?

12:29.430 --> 12:30.410
Not at all.

12:31.460 --> 12:36.990
But what if the Kingdom of Moncelle's forces 
attacked along the Ubaki Mountains?

12:37.400 --> 12:49.370
Ubaki Mountains

12:37.640 --> 12:41.260
The Ubaki mountains lie below us in 
the western region of the mainland.

12:38.320 --> 12:49.370
Kusef Peninsula

12:41.260 --> 12:45.550
Crossing them is the only way from the 
Romanoff Domain into the Kusef Peninsula.

12:45.550 --> 12:48.080
If the Ubaki Mountains were taken,

12:48.080 --> 12:50.950
then the imperial forces 
on the Kusef Peninsula

12:50.950 --> 12:53.410
would lose their supply lines and be isolated.

12:53.830 --> 12:55.920
If that were to happen, 
there would be only one outcome.

12:56.700 --> 12:58.680
The expeditionary force would be wiped out.

12:59.500 --> 13:01.860
<i>Her knowledge of international 
matters is extensive.</i>

13:01.860 --> 13:05.350
<i>I never imagined that she had such a firm 
grasp of the countries' relationships.</i>

13:13.000 --> 13:16.980
I'm so sorry! I've tired you, haven't I?

13:17.290 --> 13:19.930
A layman like me speaking 
at such length must be...

13:19.930 --> 13:24.210
No, your counsel is very impressive.

13:24.630 --> 13:29.990
But lately, there are days when 
I tire easily and take ill.

13:32.960 --> 13:34.130
Your Majesty...

13:34.130 --> 13:37.640
Could it be that even when you sleep 
for long periods, you wake tired?

13:37.640 --> 13:39.500
Yes, I do.

13:39.860 --> 13:44.850
Do you ever feel very thirsty, but even if 
you drink water, your thirst isn't slaked?

13:44.850 --> 13:45.770
Yes.

13:46.170 --> 13:48.600
Has the urge to urinate ever woken you?

13:49.070 --> 13:51.760
Yes, it has. Why?

13:53.720 --> 13:54.740
<i>Back then...</i>

13:57.090 --> 13:59.570
<i>his breaths were deep and fast.</i>

13:59.570 --> 14:03.110
<i>Oxygen deficiency caused 
His Majesty to fall into a coma,</i>

14:03.110 --> 14:04.680
<i>and his body smelled of acetone.</i>

14:03.110 --> 14:06.160
No, your counsel is very impressive.

14:05.700 --> 14:10.020
<i>And the various symptoms he listed 
just now lead me to conclude...</i>

14:06.770 --> 14:11.120
But lately, there are days when 
I tire easily and take ill.

14:10.020 --> 14:12.040
<i>The emperor's chronic illness...</i>

14:12.800 --> 14:14.800
<i>is diabetes mellitus.</i>

14:17.490 --> 14:18.800
<i>It's diabetes.</i>

14:19.200 --> 14:21.220
<i>I'm certain that's what this illness is!</i>

14:23.070 --> 14:26.800
Young lady, why did you ask such questions?

14:26.800 --> 14:30.640
And how do you know so many 
details about my health?

14:30.960 --> 14:35.550
I saw a case just like Your Majesty's 
in a medical text I read recently.

14:35.550 --> 14:36.790
A medical text?

14:36.790 --> 14:37.650
Yes.

14:37.910 --> 14:40.380
I don't remember the name of the illness,

14:40.380 --> 14:44.650
but I do remember that the cause was a 
high concentration of sugar in the blood.

14:44.650 --> 14:48.530
I'll have to mention that to Viscount Ven.

14:48.920 --> 14:51.290
<i>Viscount Ven is an outstanding doctor.</i>

14:51.290 --> 14:55.040
<i>I'm sure he'll conclude that this 
illness is diabetes from this clue.</i>

14:55.530 --> 14:58.540
<i>That should take care of His Majesty's 
illness for the time being.</i>

14:59.470 --> 15:02.250
<i>Which means, all that's left is...</i>

15:04.490 --> 15:06.340
In truth, today...

15:06.340 --> 15:09.710
there is something I earnestly wished 
to discuss with you, Your Majesty.

15:09.710 --> 15:13.810
Everything you have said 
today has been of interest.

15:14.120 --> 15:16.800
What would you like to speak of next?

15:18.440 --> 15:20.780
I am dreadfully sorry to ask this,

15:21.320 --> 15:24.360
but my betrothal to the crown prince...

15:24.360 --> 15:27.070
Could we move forward as 
though it never existed?

15:38.540 --> 15:40.890
You wish to dissolve the betrothal?

15:40.890 --> 15:42.830
What is the meaning of this, Elise?

15:42.830 --> 15:46.700
A marriage is not some 
child's entertainment!

15:50.310 --> 15:52.320
What has happened?

15:52.320 --> 15:58.080
Were you not the one who wished most 
ardently for your engagement to my son?

15:58.080 --> 16:00.680
Yes, but I've realized something.

16:02.120 --> 16:05.410
The crown princess is the 
first lady of our empire.

16:05.410 --> 16:08.740
She is an exalted personage who will one 
day become the mother of the empire.

16:08.740 --> 16:13.690
I've realized that a girl as inexperienced 
as I am is unfit for the position.

16:18.580 --> 16:21.460
My dream did not befit my stature.

16:21.930 --> 16:25.310
I am guilty of desiring more 
than my position deserves.

16:25.310 --> 16:26.480
And because of that,

16:26.480 --> 16:29.060
I am guilty of marring both your dignity 
and that of the imperial family.

16:30.590 --> 16:32.710
I will accept any punishment you deem fit.

16:33.790 --> 16:36.740
<i>This is for the best. With this, I will...</i>

16:36.740 --> 16:39.250
Is that your only reason?

16:40.930 --> 16:42.410
Raise your head.

16:49.420 --> 16:52.250
I want to become a doctor!

16:52.250 --> 16:55.000
Elise! Why would you tell such a lie?

16:55.000 --> 16:57.640
Those are not the eyes 
of someone who is lying.

16:59.320 --> 17:01.430
Then, what you said earlier...

17:01.430 --> 17:06.320
Reading a medical text was an 
expression of this desire of yours?

17:08.260 --> 17:09.270
In that case,

17:09.890 --> 17:12.380
let's make a wager.

17:12.380 --> 17:15.220
Make a wager?

17:15.650 --> 17:18.820
Pass the exams and become a doctor.

17:18.820 --> 17:23.780
Prove that your work as a doctor is more 
valuable than your existence as an empress.

17:25.910 --> 17:30.220
If you can prove that, then you 
may take whatever path you wish.

17:30.220 --> 17:33.960
But if you are unable to prove that,

17:35.010 --> 17:40.880
then you will turn all your thoughts and 
energy toward becoming our future empress.

17:42.390 --> 17:44.450
How long will I have?

17:44.740 --> 17:47.990
Until you come of age.

17:47.990 --> 17:50.320
We cannot wait longer than that.

17:51.010 --> 17:52.530
<i>Until I come of age.</i>

17:52.960 --> 17:54.860
<i>That means I have the next six months.</i>

17:55.410 --> 17:58.380
<i>This gamble will be difficult to win, but...</i>

18:02.210 --> 18:04.090
I will do my very best!

18:09.100 --> 18:10.980
As that's settled,

18:10.980 --> 18:14.700
I'm sorry for being so inconsiderate when 
you haven't seen each other in so long.

18:16.360 --> 18:19.540
You two should go on a 
walk through the garden.

18:26.200 --> 18:29.860
Why did you agree to such 
an ill-advised gamble?

18:29.860 --> 18:30.620
What?

18:31.030 --> 18:34.770
Doctors are the empire's most 
highly specialized profession.

18:35.250 --> 18:36.840
The exams are difficult,

18:36.840 --> 18:41.350
and no matter how highly ranked a noble 
might be, they are afforded no special treatment.

18:41.350 --> 18:44.240
Yes, Your Highness. I am aware of that.

18:45.360 --> 18:48.180
However, I absolutely will not give up!

18:48.180 --> 18:50.210
I will become a doctor, 
no matter what it takes.

18:54.990 --> 18:58.310
Until the moment that 
this life of mine ends,

18:58.310 --> 19:00.900
I want to save as many 
lives as I possibly can.

19:09.320 --> 19:12.920
Y-Your Highness, for everything 
that has happened...

19:13.460 --> 19:16.550
I offer my sincerest apologies.

19:18.430 --> 19:22.690
Ever since we were small, I've caused 
you no end of trouble, Your Highness.

19:23.700 --> 19:26.700
And because of my selfishness, which 
overreaches my social status,

19:26.700 --> 19:29.180
I've forced you into an engagement 
you never wanted.

19:29.620 --> 19:31.730
I'm truly so very sorry!

19:33.000 --> 19:35.960
Who said that I don't want this engagement?

19:38.440 --> 19:39.330
What?

19:50.940 --> 19:54.440
Marquis Child is making some unusual moves.

19:54.440 --> 19:57.960
He seems to be frequently meeting 
with the third prince of the empire.

19:57.960 --> 20:01.270
It may be best to stay 
abreast of his movements.

20:01.920 --> 20:07.150
Even at the best of times, the House of 
Child views the Clorence family with enmity.

20:07.150 --> 20:09.400
Don't provoke them too much.

20:09.400 --> 20:10.290
Sire.

20:10.290 --> 20:12.830
I am most grateful for your consideration.

20:13.810 --> 20:15.020
Your Majesty!

20:15.020 --> 20:18.860
I deeply apologize for 
what happened earlier.

20:18.860 --> 20:21.890
I will strictly reprimand Elise for it.

20:21.890 --> 20:23.860
What are you saying?

20:23.860 --> 20:28.590
She's matured so wonderfully, 
she truly surprised me.

20:29.130 --> 20:33.260
What if we provided the lady with an 
opportunity to work at a hospital?

20:33.610 --> 20:37.040
After a few days of toil, 
I believe she will give up.

20:38.860 --> 20:40.030
That makes sense.

20:40.030 --> 20:43.240
Then, which hospital should 
we send her to to learn?

20:43.240 --> 20:46.730
The Clorence family owns 
a hospital, I believe?

20:47.280 --> 20:48.600
The Teresa Hospital.

20:49.200 --> 20:51.890
Have her undergo her education there.

20:56.630 --> 20:59.650
I accept full responsibility 
for these events,

20:59.650 --> 21:02.200
and I will work hard so as not 
to cause you any more trouble.

21:02.720 --> 21:05.650
I know that you hate me, Your Highness,

21:05.650 --> 21:08.490
but I still demanded to have my own way.

21:08.490 --> 21:10.740
I offer my apologies once more.

21:28.270 --> 21:31.340
<i>His Highness... was angry.</i>

21:32.170 --> 21:34.310
<i>No, this is for the best.</i>

21:34.950 --> 21:38.890
<i>In my first life, I forced myself 
onto the same path as you,</i>

21:38.890 --> 21:40.860
<i>and I caused you so much suffering.</i>

21:41.910 --> 21:45.540
<i>But this life will be different.</i>

21:46.570 --> 21:50.050
<i>I will walk a completely 
different path from you.</i>

21:51.180 --> 21:52.420
<i>Goodbye.</i>

21:52.900 --> 21:54.970
<i>I hope your life is a happy one.</i>

22:01.120 --> 22:03.510
<i>You are the person I loved most of all.</i>

22:06.300 --> 22:10.050
A Gamble
